        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "15-3-4 Beginning September, 2003, inservice credit shall be granted on the basis of seven and one half (7.5) hours, or major portion thereof, for one half (1/2) credit, or fifteen (15) hours, or major portion thereof, for one (1) full credit upon satisfactory completion of the inservice.",
